. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H1 * 
. 
.         * Please add a verbal description of your model here
. 
.         * we specify a linear probability model using d_genderattitude as a p
> roxy for gender egalitarian attitudes assuming that individuals who believe t
> hat child suffers if mom is not at home have less gender egalitarian attitude
> s 
.         * Accordingly, we run a linear OLS regression analysis with d_gendera
> ttitude as dependent variable and the dummy variable d_daughter as independen
> t variable including our controls as categorial and dummy variables with culs
> tered SE on pid-level
